MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Student build drops the multi-theme marketplace for ONE mono look with a user-chosen
accent. Pick a hue (curated swatch or constrained custom slider); we synthesize the
accent with fixed saturation + mode-tuned lightness and CONTRAST-GUARD it against the
surface, so no accent can render unreadable (worst-case label contrast across the whole
wheel = 4.28:1). Crimson = exact brand red. Semantic tokens (danger red, success green)
are never touched. accentTokensFor overrides only the accent chain after applyTheme;
re-applies on boot, theme/mode change, and live picker change. Tests: accent-tint (9).
